SOLUTION 1 Pure_C
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    pH 7 charge

SOLUTION 2 Pure_Ca
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 7 charge

MIX 3
    1 1
    2 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 3
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 3
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_calcite.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -ionic_strength true
    -solution true
END